  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR takes over the work of PR #2256 by its author, by the decision of the maintainer on 2026-11-17. The branch of PR #2256 is not changed. The measurements of PR #2256 showed where to look; thanks to its author.\n\nThe viewport built two values again on each frame. The cost grew with the operation count. This PR caches the two values. Each key holds the real inputs, not `doc_version` alone (docs/decisions/2238-frame-cost-rule.md).\n\n- `crates/ui/src/path_line_memo.rs`: the overlay lines of each drawn operation. The key is:\n  - the path signature (`Toolpath::path_sig`) and the move count;\n  - the verify warnings, by equality;\n  - the palette, the dim factor, the chevron arm and the viewport ground colour.\n  A path that does not draw is not read, and its entry is dropped.\n- `crates/ui/src/solid_aabb_memo.rs`: the world box of the solids. The key is, for each model: the entity, a `Weak` of its facet `Arc` (compared by `ptr_eq`), and its pose. `interact.rs` uses it at the three call sites (gizmo length, chevron arm, height-plane reach).\n- `crates/app/src/model/toolpath_read.rs`: `with_toolpath`, `toolpath_warning_count` and `toolpath_nonempty` read the cached path in place. `operation::status_of`, the browser tree and the operation page do not clone each path on each frame.\n- `docs/decisions/2201-frame-caches.md` records the decisions.\n\nThe caches are display only. Verify, the collision checks and the post do not read them.\n\n## Readings (debug probe, ms for each frame, before -> after)\n\n| State | scene | ui | ui/viewport | labels | gizmos | overlay.toolpaths |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| f8 (8 ops, 1 selected) | 4.86 -> 2.66 | 13.50 -> 11.53 | 2.91 -> 0.71 | 1.47 -> 0.38 | 1.31 -> 0.18 | 1.28 -> 0.15 |\n| g8 (show all paths) | 5.44 -> 2.88 | 13.46 -> 11.72 | - | - | - | 1.61 -> 0.20 |\n| n8 (no selection) | 4.73 -> 2.82 | - | - | - | - | - |\n| d | 4.49 -> 2.32 | 10.28 -> 8.75 | - | - | - | - |\n| e | 4.61 -> 2.53 | 10.13 -> 8.78 | - | - | - | - |\n| b | 6.85 -> 4.71 | - | - | - | - | - |\n| c | 7.25 -> 5.19 | - | - | - | - | - |\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `path_line_memo::tests::still_calls_build_the_lines_once`\n- `path_line_memo::tests::each_input_of_the_key_builds_again` (path, warnings, palette, dim, arm, ground)\n- `path_line_memo::tests::each_operation_keeps_its_own_lines_and_undrawn_ones_are_dropped`\n- `path_line_memo::tests::append_stops_at_lines_cut_short`\n- `solid_aabb_memo::tests::still_calls_build_the_box_once`\n- `solid_aabb_memo::tests::each_input_of_the_key_builds_again` (location, rotation, new facet list, other facets, part added, part removed)\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_ops_probe::still_frames_with_many_toolpaths_name_their_costs` (still frames with 1 and 8 operations build nothing)\n\n## Gate\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -j 4`: 1024 passed, 6 ignored.\n- `camcraft-app` suites `stock_stamp`, `stale_rapid_law`, `operations`, `commands_undo`, `vertical_rapid_stock`, `wire_stamp`: all pass.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 4 -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- The full quick gate (812 steps) was not run. The touched suites above were run one by one.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No release build. The readings are debug.\n- Hover and orbit are not in the probe.\n- The GUI was not started.\n\n## Costs left\n\nThis PR removes the largest measured costs. The remaining costs are tracked rows in a comment on #2201. The largest is `operation::status_of` for each operation on each frame (browser and status bar).\n\nNo visible change, no screenshots.\n\nChangelog: The viewport keeps the toolpath lines and the model box between frames, so a project with many operations stays fast.\n\nEffort: high (no escalation).\n\nRefs #2201\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
